{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roots Devour is a strategic exploration game centered around a card-connecting mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/308e49245119dedbe7f505fd08db3b82.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a newborn eldritch, wandering through a silent, eerie forest shrouded in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extend your roots to drain the blood of pitiful creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them. Devour them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/2aed591a8a4c3b92d58abe4c555eb89b.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extending your tendrils comes at the cost of blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting to sacrifices to harvest your lifeblood, while precious water can only be obtained through limited means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the water runs dry, you shall only return to the roots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully plan your exploration and balance your use of resources and cards to venture further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to dead ends, unexpected surprises might be waiting there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond the forest to explore swamps, snow peaks, and even infiltrate human settlements\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4519a7c5c3f85fa63a70aa54e61ed6dc.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command over a hundred different types of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your deck and carefully choose where to open each card pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic use of special cards to pave your path towards godhood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each hunt, offer up blood and harvest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gain greater power in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a8536f6a7724fdec61d2cb43b7a38025.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forest, encounter \u201chumans\u201d burdened with their own secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then, as a higher being, alter their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the unseen mastermind lurking in the shadows,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or the great faith worshipped by the ignorant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape how the story ends\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/9a01c9f7e886edfb88e389436b9a31a3.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/9a01c9f7e886edfb88e389436b9a31a3.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/9a01c9f7e886edfb88e389436b9a31a3.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612690?t=1763525754","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/1e433d87fc793aa68f4674f0f206fe5bfeb191fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763525754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/218a86a7fd4916b2abb16bafb2c0be837894cd5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763525754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/218a86a7fd4916b2abb16bafb2c0be837894cd5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763525754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3435860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!!</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1a@RewindingStudio</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1aRoots Devour</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roots Devour is a strategic exploration game centered around a card-connecting mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/308e49245119dedbe7f505fd08db3b82.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a newborn eldritch, wandering through a silent, eerie forest shrouded in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extend your roots to drain the blood of pitiful creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them. Devour them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/3478de470bce882f3872d5a4d9b22c5b.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/2aed591a8a4c3b92d58abe4c555eb89b.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extending your tendrils comes at the cost of blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting to sacrifices to harvest your lifeblood, while precious water can only be obtained through limited means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the water runs dry, you shall only return to the roots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/f3da7a5c89a691ae59aa68f3b67443c5.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully plan your exploration and balance your use of resources and cards to venture further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to dead ends, unexpected surprises might be waiting there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond the forest to explore swamps, snow peaks, and even infiltrate human settlements\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4e78e22d5cbfff7536dc4afc83ed1ad8.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4519a7c5c3f85fa63a70aa54e61ed6dc.webp?t=1763525754\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command over a hundred different types of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your deck and carefully choose where to open each card pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic use of special cards to pave your path towards godhood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6ba3ab177e97692e69296f2ff8f47f19.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each hunt, offer up blood and harvest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gain greater power in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.poster.avif?t=1763525754\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.webm?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/0318a23229eae36c660329b1dc3d80a6.mp4?t=1763525754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas